<title>NETHERLANDS: CSM 96/97 first half net NLG 101.1 mln.</title>
<headline>CSM 96/97 first half net NLG 101.1 mln.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to end March 1997.</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)			2.56  vs  2.42</p>
<p>    Net profit				     101.1  vs  93.5</p>
<p>    Operating profit				149   vs  133</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)			   1.61  vs  1.45</p>
<p>    Net interest gain			     1.9   vs  6.6</p>
<p>    Tax						 49.6  vs  46.1</p>
<p>(Note - Food group CSM was expected by analysts to post a H1 net profit of between 100 and 106 million guilders.)</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
